Research Roadmap on Neurodevelopmental Outcomes in Preterm Infants
An academic research-planning resource exploring neurodevelopmental outcomes in preterm infants

This roadmap should explore:
- Overview of preterm infant neurodevelopment
- Key risk factors and complications
- Longitudinal assessment approaches
- Developmental monitoring protocols
- Intervention and support strategies
- Parental guidance and resources

Include research questions, methodology considerations, and key literature references.

Save as: Preterm_Infants_Research_Roadmap.pdf in assets/documents/